      "content": "It is incredibly draining when you put in the effort and the weight doesn't lessen, and that feeling of futility can be absolutely crushing. When the efforts to improve don't yield the peace you crave, it might be time to explore different avenues of care or support. Please consider reaching out to a crisis line or a therapist who specializes in chronic mental health struggles to talk through these deeper questions. Your desire for peace is real, and there are compassionate people who want to help you find a path toward it.",
